Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:20:57 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 031/230] Add a local SQLite backup CLI with restore and prune

Snapshot the live database through VACUUM INTO (an online, point-in-time
backup) and restore it to a fresh file, with a strict name-scoped prune.
Wires `npm run backup` / `backup:restore` and a round-trip test suite.
